      \  \"    return Path(_native_directory.name) / 'libnlms.so'\\n\",\n 'protocol': '\"\"\"Network-order routing\
      \ header + authenticated encrypted fragment or ACK.\\n'\n             '\\n'\n             'The GNU Radio graph\
      \ adds CRC32 and RS outside this layer. The simulator uses\\n'\n             'the same CRC and RS codec. Routing\
